link":"29335","synopsis":"In the Sun Kingdom, it is customary that a marriage in the royal family must earn the approval of the Ministry of the Priesthood. The Ministry rejects Nike, however, and demands that she perform the potentially fatal \"Rite of Illumination.\" Livi is worried for Nike's safety, but Nike decides to perform the rite to see herself accepted.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/anb7odWU9xIwGqAsd4LN6EczdVW.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"In the Sun Kingdom, it is customary that a marriage in the royal family must earn the approval of the Ministry of the Priesthood. The Ministry rejects Nike, however, and demands that she perform the potentially fatal \"Rite of Illumination.\" Livi is worried for Nike's safety, but Nike decides to perform the rite to see herself accepted.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/anb7odWU9xIwGqAsd4LN6EczdVW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10395","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20599","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22101","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278331","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"29334","synopsis":"Nike heads for the underground temple that serves as the site of the Rite of Illumination. Overcoming peril after peril, she finally reaches it, when she is attacked suddenly by a band of men in black. She flees from them with all her strength, but they gradually catch up, when suddenly...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ry5A6wLUoXUIOycvW0oRXvGdLRJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Nike heads for the underground temple that serves as the site of the Rite of Illumination. Overcoming peril after peril, she finally reaches it, when she is attacked suddenly by a band of men in black. She flees from them with all her strength, but they gradually catch up, when suddenly...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ry5A6wLUoXUIOycvW0oRXvGdLRJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10395","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20599","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22101","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278331","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"29340","synopsis":"Princess Luna of the Ocean Kingdom arrives, and declares herself Livi's fiance. She has loved Livi since they were children, and therefore views Nike as a rival. Nike is confused at first, but Luna's bold declaration of her feelings and effortless royal demeanor begin to fill her with anxiety.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/LomRqGXwfGx70hmzI64uoJZyfq.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Princess Luna of the Ocean Kingdom arrives, and declares herself Livi's fiance. She has loved Livi since they were children, and therefore views Nike as a rival. Nike is confused at first, but Luna's bold declaration of her feelings and effortless royal demeanor begin to fill her with anxiety.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/LomRqGXwfGx70hmzI64uoJZyfq.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10395","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20599","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22101","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278331","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"29341","synopsis":"One day, out of nowhere, Livi's uncle Bardwin (Bard) returns home. Although he once supported Livi as prime minister, Livi shows nothing but resentment towards him. Bard, for his part, also toys with Livi and makes aggressive advances on Nike. What was the real reason for Bard's return?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6NUztRUueeZZzhLOMpHZMdKVICi.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"One day, out of nowhere, Livi's uncle Bardwin (Bard) returns home. Although he once supported Livi as prime minister, Livi shows nothing but resentment towards him. Bard, for his part, also toys with Livi and makes aggressive advances on Nike. What was the real reason for Bard's return?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6NUztRUueeZZzhLOMpHZMdKVICi.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10395","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20599","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"22101","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278331","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"29339","synopsis":"It is revealed that the former prime minister, Bard, returned home out of concern for Livi. Although Livi and Bard continue to seek each other out and need each other's assistance, they never seem to come to an understanding. What will Nike do to express her vexation about the matter?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uNnWcntPPndb3WbqEdHEbpLdbgs.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"It is revealed that the former prime minister, Bard, returned home out of concern for Livi. Alt